<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Metalcorp year net profit up 44 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Metalcorp year net profit up 44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    8.41  vs  5.50</p>
<p>    Net				     5.29  vs  3.66</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    6.0   vs  5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Metalcorp Ltd is a steel fabricator and recycler.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    11.0  vs  9.5</p>
<p>    Sales				 129.14  vs 73.64</p>
<p>    Other income			  1.73  vs  0.93</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  16.43  vs 14.64</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 1</p>
<p>Reg date Sept 20</p>
<p>    Tax				     3.12  vs  1.84</p>
<p>    Interest				1.94  vs  0.34</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  1.83  vs  0.94</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
